OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain possible across Aberdeen and the
OL,7,Feast, the rain soon moving into the
OL,8,FNorth Sea. Clear spells developing and
OL,9,Fwinds mainly light and rather chilly
OL,10,Fby dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells, but cloud building with heavy
OL,14,Fshowers developing. The showers
OL,15,Fpossibly merging at times with the
OL,16,Frisk of the odd thunderstorm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
